    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whether live theater, a broadcast production, or viral shorts on the infosphere, you know how to draw an audience into your narrative, whether it's a grounded historical piece or a fantastic voyage beyond their imagination.</p><p><strong>Platform Skill</strong> Deception</p><p><strong>Hardlight Prop</strong> Your hardlight props look real unless a creature uses the Seek action to attempt a Perception check against your Spellcasting DC. They still disappear if Interacted with or held by another creature.</p><p><strong>Bonus Feat</strong> You gain the Tragic Protagonist class feat.</p><p><strong>Stagecraft Spells</strong></p><ul><li><p><em>initial:</em> leading actor</p></li><li><p><em>advanced:</em> soliloquy</p></li><li><p><em>greater:</em> final confrontation</p></li></ul>",
